{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/54","id":4598396729,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUaKq7M8AAAABEhX3OQ","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/54","diff_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/54.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/54.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/54","number":54,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(authoring): 生成小节、习题集与测验组草稿并恢复原任务","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"作者现在可以明确选择既有 Concept，以及习题集所属 Lesson，在同一 Job 的一次 Provider 许可下生成小节、习题集或测验的计划和整组未审草稿。计划、成员与私解绑定完整哈希并持久化；原受检结果可在重启后恢复，不新增模型调用。题目私解通过独立受保护入口读取，成员数值计划仍需逐次单独拒绝或批准。\n\n同时修复两处独立审查发现：数值检查在使用候选前重新核验原 Provider 产物；权限或工作区变化时，在 IndexedDB 写入准入前阻止私有命令/ACK 持久化。安全取消及已合法提交的原 ACK 保留。\n\n- task_id / Issue：M6.1，关联 #30；依赖 #53，本 PR 基于 `feat/M6.1-worked-example`。保持草稿，不关闭阶段。\n- 唯一规范：PRODUCT_DESIGN.md 3.0.7，SHA `2d1ecce71e0aa6953c0f772b1935e7e3abdc5933bfbbe93d851a6171236d8a4d`。\n- 契约/迁移：新增六个组创作端口；专有严格 DTO 与旧/组封闭读口联合。迁移 0015 保存计划、候选组和成员数值预览；54 core、0001 与学习包 3.0.0 保持不变。未将生成内容发布或写入 Import 假身份。\n- 固定验证源码：`9d4aa2e75c0583b4752e1a2669534ef621e6c7f9`。完整本地门禁：Python 2169 passed / 1 环境 skipped；web 441 passed；native 99 passed（9.1 分钟）；Ruff、mypy 177 源文件、web lint/types/build、spec 76 生成产物校验均通过。939 个源码及受跟踪文件在门禁前匹配固定 Git；native 改变 4 PNG 和 1 浏览器版本记录，前后 44 件均保存，精确恢复后再次匹配同一提交。\n- 已完成定向证据：三根实际浏览器 prepare/同 Job 许可/持久化/同 SQLite 新进程回读/作者权限锁/第二未许可任务安全取消；assessment 显式 Concept-only、两种模式和 600 秒，私解成员分别拒绝与批准。后端五题型通过完整受控 Provider 链，私解不入公开投影/控制/真实索引；三根恢复只消费一次原结果。\n- 截图：本次实际 1440/390 题面、私解、公式和数值状态随门禁证据提供。旧失败、后续修复及各自输入清单分别保存。\n- 安全与公开内容：仅工程文件、原创合成测试材料及逐项核验的脱敏证据；无用户 API key、数据库、会话或浏览器配置目录。Provider 历史完整性与存储权限修复有独立复审。\n- 尚未验收：本轮 lesson/assessment 两个组成员数值尝试实际 `BLOCKED/environment_unavailable`（exit 1）；隔离环境未允许计算，不回退普通进程。生产 InputProof 未建立，平台真实 DeepSeek 端到端、外部搜索、数学/来源/教学质量仍 NOT_RUN；M6.2 发布与 M6.3 Codex 未包含。\n- 下一任务：记录本 PR 确切 head 的 CI 终态和真实失败；继续解决生产输入证明与数值隔离阻塞，再推进 M6.1 验收。原 #53 的 CI 失败不由本地通过覆盖。\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T04:13:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T04:19:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6aa987b3bdb2610ad369775f01ac743405e5ce86","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/54/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/54/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/54/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/2cf5caa3f966f919997c37b64d0bbf0e332438df","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M6.1-group-drafts","ref":"feat/M6.1-group-drafts","sha":"2cf5caa3f966f919997c37b64d0bbf0e332438df","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https